oyment or property, HMRC now expects digital records and quarterly updates. This app keeps those records the way HMRC wants them, with none of your data leaving your phone.\n\nLOG IT IN SECONDS\n• Snap a receipt or invoice — on-device AI reads the amount, date and merchant. Nothing is ever uploaded.\n• Share PDFs or images straight from Mail, Files or Photos.\n• Recurring rent, bills and retainers log themselves.\n• Categories match HMRC's quarterly update fields exactly — including separate residential finance costs. Add your own categories too.\n\nKNOW WHAT YOU OWE\n• Live estimate: income tax, Class 4 National Insurance, dividend tax, payments on account — updated with every entry.\n• Chart your year like a stock: 1W to full tax year, with upcoming recurring amounts and every HMRC deadline overlaid.\n• Pending invoices tracked as money owed to you, excluded from the estimate until paid.\n• See what's carried over from last year, and what paying late would actually cost.\n\nNEVER MISS A DEADLINE\n• Every quarterly update window (standard or calendar election), plus payment deadlines and nil-update reminders.\n• Notifications a week before, a day before, and on the day.\n• Home-screen widget with your next deadline and estimated bill.\n\nYEAR-END, SORTED (PRO)\n• CSV of every entry plus cumulative quarterly category totals — the exact format your accountant or bridging software needs. CSV export is an HMRC-accepted digital link.\n• One-page PDF tax summary.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nNo accounts. No cloud. No analytics. Your income, expenses and receipt images stay on your device.\n\nThis app produces estimates, not tax advice, and does not file with HMRC. Not affiliated with HM Revenue & Customs.", "minimumOsVersion": "26.0", "userRatingCount": 0}]}